  "bio": "Simon Hanna is an incredibly skilled tattoo artist, specializing in the intricate 'fineline' style, located in Lisbon, Portugal. Residing at the Crucio Tattoo Studio, he engages with each client to customize tattoos based on their unique life stories, demonstrating superior professionalism in his craft.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Lisbon, Portugal"
